@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
node "演示主机" {
  artifact "浏览器\nVue页面" as Browser
  node "单个Docker运行容器" {
    node "单同步Python应用服务" as Server {
      component "Django API与领域服务" as API
      artifact "Vue静态构建产物" as Static
    }
  }
  database "持久化卷 /data\nSQLite、配置、编号序列" as Data
}
Browser --> API : 同源HTTP /api/v1
Browser --> Static : HTTP静态资源
API --> Data : 事务读写
note bottom of Server
无登录权限、Redis、Celery或独立数据库服务
构建阶段使用Node，运行不需要Node服务
end note
@enduml
